messages.content:
You MUST output valid JSON matching this exact schema. No other output.

Schema:
{
  "id": "<UUID string>",
  "timestamp": "<ISO 8601>",
  "environment": "production" | "staging" | "development",
  "service": {
    "name": "<string>",
    "version": "<semver>",
    "image": "<docker-image:tag>"
  },
  "deployer": {
    "username": "<string>",
    "email": "<string>"
  },
  "changes": [
    { "file": "<string>", "type": "added" | "modified" | "deleted", "lines_changed": <integer> }
  ],
  "rollback_available": <boolean>,
  "health_check_url": "<URL>"
}
